<view class="page">
  <view class="section-title">服务费确认</view>
  <view class="card warning">
    <view class="rule-line">当前为支付占位，仅模拟服务费记录进入锁定状态。</view>
    <view class="rule-line">真实微信支付、分账、退款和放款必须等待支付服务商与合规确认。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="fee-row"><text>帮带服务费</text><text>{{fee.serviceFee}}</text></view>
    <view class="fee-row"><text>平台服务费</text><text>{{fee.platformFee}}</text></view>
    <view class="fee-row total"><text>合计</text><text>{{fee.total}}</text></view>
  </view>

  <button class="primary-button" loading="{{submitting}}" bindtap="confirmMockPayment">确认支付占位（演示）</button>
</view>
